  offerLine: Snff. Snff snff. You've been in the bush. I can smell it. I love the bush. Find me some mushrooms, fresh ones, and I'll come with you next time.
  activeLine: Mushrooms! Three! Fresh! Snff!
  readyLine: Oh, they're perfect. Oh, I'm coming with you. I've decided. Nobody's stopping me. I'm very fast, in a way. Here, I sat on this rock for a year. You have it.
  doneLine: Take me foraging! I'm ready!
